# Hybrid Expert System for Potato Disease Diagnosis Using Deep Learning

## Overview

This project presents a hybrid artificial intelligence system for
automatic potato leaf disease diagnosis.

The system combines:

1. Convolutional Neural Network
2. Rule-Based Expert System
3. Disease Recommendation Module
4. Streamlit Application

## Disease Classes

- Healthy
- Early Blight
- Late Blight

## System Architecture

Image
 ↓
Preprocessing
 ↓
CNN
 ↓
Disease Prediction
 ↓
Confidence Check
 ↓
Expert System
 ↓
Diagnosis + Recommendation

## Technologies

- Python
- TensorFlow/Keras
- CNN
- Scikit-learn
- OpenCV
- Streamlit

## Results

The research model achieved approximately 88% validation accuracy.

